sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant E as Executor
    participant M as Model
    participant T as Tools
    C->>E: stream message
    E-->>C: WORKING
    E->>M: prompt + tools
    M-->>E: call service_status
    E->>T: service_status(billing)
    T-->>E: error: no billing
    E->>M: error as result
    M-->>E: call list_services
    E->>T: list_services()
    T-->>E: three names
    E->>M: result
    M-->>E: answer
    E-->>C: answer, tool-trace
    E-->>C: COMPLETED
